# govulncheck findings in the pinned metrics-server build, accepted one advisory
# at a time. build.sh refuses a finding unless a line here matches its id, its
# module AND its found version, and the line has not expired. A line expires on
# its until= date, or as soon as the recipe's pinned version is no longer its
# pin= (the next upstream release), whichever comes first. govulncheck failing
# for any reason other than findings (a network error included) is a failure.
#
# Accept a finding only with a reason resting on govulncheck's source-mode call
# traces over the pinned module (README.md, Reachability). The graph's security
# fixes (build.sh MS_FIXES) leave no finding to accept.
#
# <id> <module> <found> <fixed> until=<YYYY-MM-DD> pin=<version> <reason>
